MetaMedQA — licence and attribution
===================================

This directory redistributes data derived from MetaMedQA.

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
Licence:                 CC BY 4.0
Full licence text:       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Upstream dataset:        https://huggingface.co/datasets/Maximegmd/MetaMedQA

Citation
--------
Griot, M., Hemptinne, C., Vanderdonckt, J. & Yuksel, D. Large Language Models
lack essential metacognition for reliable medical reasoning. Nat. Commun. 16,
642 (2025).

Files in this directory
-----------------------
  metamedqa.json

Modifications
-------------
The data here is not the upstream distribution. It has been modified as follows,
and these changes are the responsibility of the Prj-BENCH authors, not the
upstream authors:

  - Converted to the common Prj-BENCH multiple-choice JSON schema
    (id / question / options / target / kind).
  - Randomly sampled 400 from the 'original' category; all items from the other categories.
  - No quality-control exclusions applied (this is the pre-QC release).
